 to the         EVM verification gateway.         Two duties:         1. Pins the SP1 program verification key for the            `realized-statement-sp1-program.v1` guest and delegates            cryptographic proof verification to an `ISP1Verifier`            (canonical SP1 Groth16 verifier, or MockSP1Verifier for tests).         2. Extracts the `statementRoot` from the guest's fixed-width EVM            public values (a single `bytes32`, ABI-decoded). No JSON parsing.         EVM boundary:           canonical statement             \\u2192 SHA-256             \\u2192 32-byte root             \\u2192 SP1 public value (bytes32)             \\u2192 abi.decode(publicValues, (bytes32))\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/PrfRealizedAllocationVerifierAdapter.sol\":\"PrfRealizedAllocationVerifierAdapter\"},\"evmVersion\":\"prague\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":@openzeppelin/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\",\":ds-test/=lib/forge-std/lib/ds-test/src/\",\":erc4626-tests/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/lib/erc4626-tests/\",\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\",\":halmos-cheatcodes/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/lib/halmos-cheatcodes/src/\",\":openzeppelin-contracts/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\"]},\"sources\":{\"src/ISP1Verifier.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0x546a397653cecbe54ccbc4cb85bcc8a57bdc974d2fec644b5a5dce62075110b6\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://40dbf1504a5a3ca7cb59487b8a0e51618ac2a01149d6c9410f7dc51bde5fa3df\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmSEAX3MGydcjfKW6WxLr2n375Wtto95tqprczVdiHPu9x\"]},\"src/PrfRealizedAllocationVerifierAdapter.sol\":{\"keccak256\":\"0xa7b53b3a0a1b2d0aea3366aa9a2fc1335e4f06b999358460e88b26ad95f62ce3\",\"license\":\"Apache-2.0\",\"urls\":[\"bzz-raw://1a498839f137f865eb211eb604746027667ae08102d8422333a6c59971862469\",\"dweb:/ipfs/QmdcQGMjkKHdGNKNDcG17aqEhuRuV7oJ2TMLtjduCEREur\"]}},\"version\":1}","metadata":{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.33+commit.64118f2